    {
        "title": "Idea2Impact Hackathon",
        "venue": "NxtWave",
        "date": "August 2026",
        "sortDate": "2026-08-02",
        "category": "edtech",
        "type": "🎤 Panel Discussion",
        "image": "./assets/images/speaking-engagements/nxtwave-idea2impact.jpg",
        "description": "<p>Invited as a panelist at the finals of Idea2Impact — NxtWave's first in-person hackathon for its Academy students — alongside Harshit Singh (Amazon), with Harshitha (NxtWave) moderating. The conversation engaged 350+ builders across hackathons, career growth, interview preparation, and the fast-moving frontiers of AI.</p><p><strong>Key Takeaways:</strong></p><ul><li>How to approach hackathons as an opportunity to build, learn, and stand out</li><li>Habits and working methods that compound into differentiated careers</li><li>Practical preparation for SWE, Applied Science, and Data Science interviews</li><li>Lessons from career progression and navigating high-growth roles</li><li>How builders can adapt and stay relevant through the AI wave</li><li>Audience questions pushed the discussion into consciousness in AI, sustainable AI, and AGI</li></ul>",
        "upcoming": false,
        "links": [
