        "category": "universities",
        "type": "🎤 Panel Discussion",
        "image": "./assets/images/speaking-engagements/ai-student-summit-2026.png",
        "description": "<p>Participated in a strategic panel discussion at the AI Student Summit 2026 (KLH University, Hyderabad), engaging with an audience of 3,500+ students on the future trajectory of Artificial Intelligence in India. The panel explored the acceleration of AI adoption across sectors, the role of India's AI startup ecosystem in driving innovation and economic advancement, and the critical dimensions of responsible and ethical AI.</p><p><strong>Topics Discussed:</strong></p><ul><li>The future trajectory of AI in India and the acceleration of AI adoption across sectors</li><li>Role of the AI startup ecosystem in driving innovation and economic advancement</li><li>Responsible and ethical AI: policy frameworks and governance</li><li>Talent development and building the next generation of AI practitioners</li><li>Scalable AI deployment within the Indian context</li></ul>",
