        "image": null,
        "description": "<p>Conducted a hands-on vibe-coding workshop for Microsoft's extended senior leadership team during their offsite, demonstrating how AI-powered coding with GitHub Copilot can transform engineering workflows. The session went beyond surface-level tool usage, guiding leaders through practical exercises that culminated in live demos and prototypes built in real-time.</p><p><strong>Key Topics Covered:</strong></p><ul><li>Using GitHub Copilot effectively — moving beyond basic autocomplete to AI-first development</li><li>Hands-on exercises: leaders building and iterating on prototypes during the session</li><li>Framing AI-powered development in terms of strategic value, not just capability</li><li>Live demo showcase: leaders sharing their prototypes and ideas built collaboratively with AI</li></ul>",
