        "description": "<p>Co-taught with Devidas Gupta, this two-day instructor-led course at Microsoft India (Cloud + AI, IDC) equipped software engineers with the foundational knowledge and practical skills to build AI-driven capabilities using agentic paradigms. The course combined classroom instruction with hands-on labs, grounding AI in engineering discipline.</p><p><strong>Course Content:</strong></p><ul><li>Foundational knowledge of AI, agents, and agentic protocols</li><li>MCP Servers and popular frameworks &amp; tools for agent development</li><li>Common components of AI-based capabilities and a workflow for AI feature development</li><li>Security and Responsible AI (RAI) considerations</li><li>Verification and validation techniques for agentic systems</li><li>Optimization techniques for production agent deployments</li><li>Hands-on labs reinforcing classroom discussions throughout both days</li></ul>",
