        "description": "<p>Kicked off a full-day Vibe Coding workshop for 100+ students from Heartfulness International School at Microsoft Garage, as part of the Microsoft Give Campaign. The session introduced students to AI-first development — not just typing code, but thinking with AI, co-creating with tools like GitHub Copilot, and turning curiosity into shipped projects.</p><p><strong>Key Topics Covered:</strong></p><ul><li>Introduction to Vibe Coding: what it means to think and build with AI as a co-creator</li><li>Live demos of playful projects built with GitHub Copilot</li><li>Hands-on session: students building their own PacMan game variants from scratch</li><li>Publishing live games on GitHub Pages — from idea to deployed project in one session</li><li>Shifting mindset from \"learning about tech\" to creating with it</li></ul>",
