        "description": "<p>A recurring hands-on workshop series at SkillUp AI (Microsoft Garage India), guiding participants through the Garage Growth Framework — a structured innovation methodology that uses AI tools at every stage to accelerate the journey from opportunity identification to sponsor-ready pitch. Multiple sessions were delivered across Microsoft's Hyderabad and Noida campuses over 2024–2025.</p><p><strong>Key Topics Covered (following the Garage Growth Framework):</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Pre-Ideate:</strong> Crafting \"How Might We\" opportunity statements and using AI to enhance and refine them</li><li><strong>Ideate:</strong> Generating radical ideas with AI, then rating, ranking, and rationalizing them using structured criteria (desirability, feasibility, innovation level, market opportunity)</li><li><strong>Hack:</strong> Creating storyboards, prototypes, and demo videos using AI tools to bring ideas to life</li><li><strong>Validate:</strong> Generating discovery interview scripts and simulating persona responses to test ideas before building</li><li><strong>Sponsor:</strong> Building pitch decks, project outlines, and video scripts with AI assistance to secure sponsorship</li></ul>",
