        "description": "<p>Delivered as a mentorship session for GrowthSchool's Mastermind project, this workshop — \"AI Toolkit for Entrepreneurs: From Concept to Pitch in Record Time\" — guided aspiring entrepreneurs through a structured, AI-powered journey from initial idea generation to a polished pitch deck and promotional video.</p><p><strong>Workshop Modules:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Module 1 — Generating &amp; Validating Ideas with AI:</strong> Using specific prompts to generate diverse product ideas, refining based on user feedback and market trends, interpreting AI-driven market insights, and identifying profitable opportunities</li><li><strong>Module 2 — Building a Landing Page with AI:</strong> Step-by-step walkthrough of setting up templates, using AI to populate content and generate section ideas, customizing with branding elements, and crafting effective calls-to-action</li><li><strong>Module 3 — Creating a Pitch Deck &amp; Promotional Video with AI:</strong> Building visually appealing pitch decks with Gamma, simplifying complex data with AI, and creating engaging video pitches with Clipchamp</li></ul>",
