    {
        "title": "Meet a Data Scientist, ML, AI & Data Science",
        "venue": "MLADS Conference | Microsoft (Virtual)",
        "date": "May 2023",
        "sortDate": "2023-05",
        "category": "conferences",
        "type": "🗣️ Talk",
        "image": "./assets/images/speaking-engagements/meet-a-data-scientist.jpeg",
        "description": "<p>Featured as the youngest speaker alongside four other professionals at the \"Meet a Data Scientist — Hyderabad\" session, organized as part of Microsoft's MLADS (Machine Learning, AI &amp; Data Science) Conference. The session involved sharing personal career journeys, connecting with data enthusiasts, answering audience queries, and discussing career prospects in Data Science.</p><p><strong>Key Takeaways Shared:</strong></p><ul><li>Focus on building a T-shaped skillset early in your career — breadth across domains, depth in one</li><li>It's all about the data: ML, DL, LLMs, and analytics tools are just means to efficiently solve problems</li><li>The art of Data Storytelling is a must-have skill — data needs to be explained and actionable insights must be derived</li><li>Fail fast to succeed faster — embrace experimentation and learn from setbacks</li><li>Leadership is a mindset, not just a job title — take initiative and show accountability</li></ul>",
