        "image": "./assets/images/speaking-engagements/dvc-pycaret-fastapi-ml-workflow.jpg",
        "description": "<p>Featured as a DVC Community Spotlight, this talk demonstrated a streamlined end-to-end machine learning workflow combining three powerful open-source tools. The session showed how to version data and experiments with DVC, rapidly prototype and compare models with PyCaret, and serve predictions through a production-ready FastAPI application.</p><p><strong>Key Topics Covered:</strong></p><ul><li>DVC (Data Version Control): versioning datasets and tracking ML experiments reproducibly</li><li>PyCaret: low-code ML library for rapid model experimentation and comparison</li><li>FastAPI: building fast, production-grade APIs for model serving</li><li>Integrating the three tools into a cohesive, reproducible ML workflow</li></ul>",
